  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img width=\"1247\" height=\"935\" src=\"/media/archive/3fc8ba9d95f7f36c5791b33d27075721f2295d57ca3a87d455edb005bf697eb3.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"People on the booth\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">\"Guild members Joan Carroll, Phyllis Charles and Karen Shortsleeve took over three artists shacks Saquatucket Harbor to exhibit their work.  They were joined by Norm Stafford and the7/7 plein aire artists Larry Folding, Matt Connors and Aaron O'Brien.\"</figcaption></figure>\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"image-sizes\">Sizes: <a href=\"/media/archive/3fc8ba9d95f7f36c5791b33d27075721f2295d57ca3a87d455edb005bf697eb3.jpg\" class=\"image-size-link\" title=\"Archived original image; this historical size option is not reproduced\">150 × 150</a> <span class=\"sep\">/</span> <a href=\"/media/archive/3fc8ba9d95f7f36c5791b33d27075721f2295d57ca3a87d455edb005bf697eb3.jpg\" class=\"image-size-link\" title=\"Archived original image; this historical size option is not reproduced\">300 × 225</a> <span class=\"sep\">/</span> <a href=\"/media/archive/3fc8ba9d95f7f36c5791b33d27075721f2295d57ca3a87d455edb005bf697eb3.jpg\" class=\"image-size-link\" title=\"Archived original image; this historical size option is not reproduced\">1,024 × 768</a> <span class=\"sep\">/</span> <a href=\"/media/archive/3fc8ba9d95f7f36c5791b33d27075721f2295d57ca3a87d455edb005bf697eb3.jpg\" class=\"image-size-link\" title=\"Archived original image; this historical size option is not reproduced\">175 × 131</a> <span class=\"sep\">/</span> <a href=\"/media/archive/3fc8ba9d95f7f36c5791b33d27075721f2295d57ca3a87d455edb005bf697eb3.jpg\" class=\"image-size-link\" title=\"Archived original image; this historical size option is not reproduced\">667 × 500</a> <span class=\"sep\">/</span> <a href=\"/media/archive/3fc8ba9d95f7f36c5791b33d27075721f2295d57ca3a87d455